            <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #3498db;"><i class="fa fa-cogs"></i> What You'll Build</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 0;"><strong>In this full-day hands-on workshop, you'll design and deploy a working Orchestrator Harness:</strong> a custom multi-agent system that takes a feature request from idea to shipped, tested, and documented software with minimal human intervention. By the end, you'll have a functional template you can bring back to your team.</p>
